comm p50  = fused_p50/ctrl_p50: tail-immune. If it stays flat while
            comm avg rises, the rise is outlier iterations, not cost.
comm skew = fused_mean/max_r(ctrl_mean): charges each rank only for
            comm, not for its peers' spread (fused waits on the
            slowest producer either way).
comm abs  = fused-ctrl in us. Compare THIS across shapes -- comm_sd's
            denominator moves with K, so ratios are not comparable
            once K changes.
timing order: fused,ctrl,base (300 iters, 30 warmup)

struct = ctrl/base: cost of the kernel restructuring alone (static
scheduler, swizzle, smem carveout; comm switched off).
comm = fused/ctrl: cost of the communication alone (flag publishes,
NVLink pulls, fp16 reduction, slowest-peer tail).
worst-rank: total 1.109, comm 1.114. flux pays this to keep the
epilogue local instead of remote-writing (v1 exp3 measures that option).
